OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F382A1785930477
OL,3,CTribute to 'family girl' who died in
OL,4,Cmulti-vehicle crash in Sussex
OL,6,FThe family of a 20-year-old
OL,7,Fhairdresser who died in a crash in
OL,8,FSussex have paid tribute to their
OL,9,F'joyful' and 'beautiful girl'.
OL,11,FOn Wednesday 15 July, Amber Street
OL,12,Ffrom Pagham was a passenger involved
OL,13,Fin a three-vehicle collision on the
OL,14,FA27 near Arundel.
OL,16,FShe sadly died and three other people
OL,17,Fwere injured.
OL,19,FIn a statement, Amber was described as
OL,20,Fa 'family girl' with 'infectious
OL,21,Fjoyfulness'.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/5
