PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F382A1785930477
OL,3,CTribute to 'family girl' who died in
OL,4,Cmulti-vehicle crash in Sussex
OL,6,FThe tribute from her family reads:
OL,7,F"From a young age, Amber's generosity
OL,8,Fand love for others shone through,
OL,9,Fonly growing stronger as she entered
OL,10,Fadulthood. At times, silly and
OL,11,Fplayful, her infectious joyfulness is
OL,12,Ffondly remembered by her family and
OL,13,Ffriends.
OL,15,F"Amber was hardworking and talented,
OL,16,Fand she excelled in her chosen
OL,17,Fprofession. She begun training as a
OL,18,Fhairdresser in Chichester in her late
OL,19,Fteenage years and went on to build a
OL,20,Fcareer doing what she loved."
OL,26,@oD@AOUwD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/5
