OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,383,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F382A1785930477
OL,3,CTribute to 'family girl' who died in
OL,4,Cmulti-vehicle crash in Sussex
OL,6,F"She was a beautiful girl with a
OL,7,Fwonderfully generous nature. She loved
OL,8,Fher family more than anything and was
OL,9,Falways thinking of others. She had a
OL,10,Fsense of care and compassion for
OL,11,Fothers that was unmatched.
OL,13,F"Her loss is hard to bear but whilst
OL,14,Ftragic and incomprehensible, in her
OL,15,Fall-too-short life Amber impacted us
OL,16,Fall in profound ways, the legacy of
OL,17,Fwhich we will carry with us forever.
OL,26,@nD@AOUuD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/5
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,383,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38204
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F382A1785930477
OL,3,CTribute to 'family girl' who died in
OL,4,Cmulti-vehicle crash in Sussex
OL,6,F"We are forever changed by having
OL,7,Fknown her and we feel blessed to have
OL,8,Fbeen touched by someone with such a
OL,9,Fwondrous spirit. We want to honour the
OL,10,Fperson Amber was by amplifying that
OL,11,Fspirit and living lives that pay
OL,12,Ftribute to it every day.
OL,14,F"Amber leaves behind her father, Ben,
OL,15,Fmother, Emily, younger brother, Harry,
OL,16,Fand a large extended family, who are
OL,17,Fall devastated by her loss."
OL,26,@nD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G4/5
